{"name":"Marrakech Mile","hex":"#01b2bd","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"mile","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The international mile: a unit of length precisely equal to 1.609344 kilometers established by treaty among Anglophone nations in 1959, divided into 5,280 feet or 1,760 yards.","Any of several customary units of length derived from the 1593 English statute mile of 8 furlongs, equivalent to 5,280 feet or 1,760 yards of various precise values."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mile"}],"entries":[{"title":"Marrakesh","blocks":[{"text":"Marrakesh or Marrakech is the fourth-largest city in Morocco. It is one of the four imperial cities of Morocco and is the capital of the Marrakesh-Safi region. The city lies west of the foothills of the Atlas Mountains."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9c/Pavillon_Menarag%C3%A4rten.jpg/330px-Pavillon_Menarag%C3%A4rten.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marrakesh","wikidata":"Q101625"},{"title":"Mile","blocks":[{"text":"The mile, sometimes the international mile or statute mile to distinguish it from other miles, is a British imperial unit and United States customary unit of length; both are based on the older English unit of length equal to 5,280 English feet, or 1,760 yards. The statute mile was standardised as a unit of length between the Commonwealth of Nations and the United States by an international agreement in 1959, when the yard was formally redefined with respect to SI units as 0.9144 metres, making the mile exactly 1609.344 metres. For everyday use, five miles equates roughly to eight kilometres. Mileage is the term used informally for a distance expressed in miles."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/Milestone%2C_Knightsbridge%2C_London_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1590514.jpg/330px-Milestone%2C_Knightsbridge%2C_London_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1590514.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mile","wikidata":"Q253276"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Marrakech_Koutoubia_Mosque_%2854273634927%29.jpg/500px-Marrakech_Koutoubia_Mosque_%2854273634927%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Marrakech_Koutoubia_Mosque_%2854273634927%29.jpg/1280px-Marrakech_Koutoubia_Mosque_%2854273634927%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Marrakech_Koutoubia_Mosque_%2854273634927%29.jpg/500px-Marrakech_Koutoubia_Mosque_%2854273634927%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMarrakech_Koutoubia_Mosque_(54273634927).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Le_jardin_des_majorelle_l3.JPG/500px-Le_jardin_des_majorelle_l3.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Le_jardin_des_majorelle_l3.JPG/1280px-Le_jardin_des_majorelle_l3.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Le_jardin_des_majorelle_l3.JPG/500px-Le_jardin_des_majorelle_l3.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALe_jardin_des_majorelle_l3.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Bab_Agnaou%2C_Marrakesh%2C_Morocco%2C_20250125_1255_7243.jpg/500px-Bab_Agnaou%2C_Marrakesh%2C_Morocco%2C_20250125_1255_7243.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/common